# The repository root sets `* text eol=lf`. That is an explicit `text` attribute rather than
# `text=auto`, so git applies CRLF->LF normalisation to every file without running its binary
# detection - which would silently strip 0x0D bytes out of the model and texture files and ship
# a corrupted asset. Mark them binary so they round-trip byte for byte.
*.blend binary
*.fbx   binary
*.glb   binary
*.gltf  binary
*.png   binary
